{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_010_22_5_06_010_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fe129c9b05463cba27eb7ea8b08563a70d155a9d46011d7f277911dc87035e7a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_010_22_5_06_010_22:5_06_010_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca92333547a17399f445ff3c5f967d2d91d722e0ff6cc5c22786f19355112a27",
      "text": "距正式开演前的倒计时",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_010_22_5_06_010_22:5_06_010_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_010_22_5_06_010_22:5_06_010_22:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a88affccf0bba070e9960ce5f0cbe0f2613930b5e05815207f27384b6ae1b4ed",
      "text": "Mr. 硲、Mr. 山下！\n我想到了一个good idea哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_010_22_5_06_010_22:5_06_010_22:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3180f6d8d2607a71b16c58e58af0414530b3bc1793bf5ab25c8802d3bf643f5c",
      "text": "面向下一次的live，大家一起\n做个countdown企划如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_010_22_5_06_010_22:5_06_010_22:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7eba3a0fc3966c3033e390ea5b11a9f351d505198fb6a76af3d3a4ba95ce97aa",
      "text": "原来如此，这是个好提案。\n事不宜迟，立刻想想具体该做些什么内容吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_010_22_5_06_010_22:5_06_010_22:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1993b650dcea498b2fd5fcd89d60e8e86dbdb9b24ccc7edeba16b2d63b740521",
      "text": "诶，现在开始吗！？\n光是练习就已经筋疲力尽了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_010_22_5_06_010_22:5_06_010_22:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0193312ee5f858f14ad717293be0cc60c356263d3dd0cec6a84ee5d82cdc84b",
      "text": "打起精神来，Mr. 山下！\n这次的live，凡事challenge都很重要哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_010_22_5_06_010_22:5_06_010_22:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b74922fd99bbda849887947d74c686053b1162e1fcb4c700f91dee0fadf139d0",
      "text": "……算了，光是想想方案的话\n也不怎么消耗体力，倒也无所谓啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_010_22_5_06_010_22:5_06_010_22:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9b873e23547a87748863e91bd927a03c9af5e9015212d023499d2c02e7ef5ae",
      "text": "Cafe Parade那边也在考虑为了炒热气氛而做企划呢。\n必须注意不要让内容撞车。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_010_22_5_06_010_22:5_06_010_22:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d4f3ad1ca859c406226f3fb6291c0c3a6523708666e695ab7548d161199041d",
      "text": "等我们的方案整理好，在明天的联合排练上\n找制作人和大家提一下试试看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_010_22_5_06_010_22:5_06_010_22:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a779845c020fb55438b33569351c8e4226aa7e0facaea1af8db8115b913c0962",
      "text": "说的也是呢！\n在那之前先构思一个special的idea吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_010_22_5_06_010_22:5_06_010_22:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cab0d83b7458ac3d406a6144cd29aba420d246cbcd4054f2169e1d7628d57e00",
      "text": "也是呢。\n难得做一次，就选个能让粉丝开心的内容吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
